## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical understanding of concurrency basics (bounded queues, per-source FIFO), plus real-world concerns: backpressure, fairness, and degradation under load. It also probes testing discipline for ordering guarantees and shutdown behavior.

## Key Concepts

- Per-service FIFO buffers
- Bounded global queue and backpressure
- Degradation policy prioritizing high-severity logs
- Fairness across services under contention
- Graceful shutdown and error handling

